ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\" (\n45:     fastboot flash cache \"..\\..\\..\\experimento\\11_VALIDACION_OTA_Y_FIRMWARE_ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\"\n46: ) else (\n47:     fastboot erase cache\n48: )\n49: fastboot erase userdata\n50: \n51: echo ============================================================================\n52: echo [+] PROCESO COMPLETADO. RETENIENDO CAJA EN FASTBOOT (ANTI-WATCHDOG ACTIVO)\n53: echo     La caja NO se reiniciara sola. Presiona Ctrl+C cuando desees salir.\n54: echo ============================================================================\n55: :KEEP_ALIVE\n56: fastboot getvar version >nul 2>&1\n57: timeout /t 2 /nobreak >nul\n58: goto KEEP_ALIVE\n(no newline at end of file)"}
